{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55219","headline":"皇帝癸未年膺运灭梁再兴（缺）迎太后七言诗 · 李存勖","name":"皇帝癸未年膺运灭梁再兴（缺）迎太后七言诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禁烟节假赏幽闲，迎奉倾心乐贵颜。\n䴏语雕梁声猗狔，鹦吟[绿]（渌）树韵开关。\n爲安家国千场战，思忆慈亲两鬓斑。\n孝道未能全报得，直须顶戴遶弥山。\n（〖1〗刘铭恕《斯坦因劫经录》云：「按《全唐文》一零四唐庄宗《亲至怀州奉迎太后敕》，略谓天下已定，理应到汾州亲迎太后，不得已只到怀州迎接，是知迎太后诗，即爲此时作品。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李存勖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}